92	     2	//! selectively disclosable claims.
93	     3	//!
94	     4	//! Every signature in the system covers the RFC 8785 (JCS) form of a document
95	     5	//! with its `proof` member removed, so a document signed by the wallet and
96	     6	//! verified here (or the other way round) hashes the same bytes on both sides.
97	     7	
98	     8	use base64::engine::general_purpose::URL_SAFE_NO_PAD;
